Maintainer: Michael Bell <bell_michael_a@lilly.com>
Description: Bindings to 'jsTree' <https://www.jstree.com>, a 'JavaScript'
    library for interactive trees, to enable rich, editable trees in 'Shiny'
    applications. Trees can be searched, checked, rearranged,
    styled and remembered across visits, loaded lazily for very large
    hierarchies, and built from data frames, 'data.tree' objects or
    ontologies.
